{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Көргөн жан туруп калбаптыр,", "text": "Көргөн жан туруп калбаптыр,", "en": "No one who saw it could remain standing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle verb is pale; туруп is the closest visual reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Баякса азыр жетүүсүз,", "text": "Баякса азыр жетүүсүз,", "en": "Now it seems beyond all reach,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Both баякса and жетүүсүз are provisional readings of faint handwriting; English gives the apparent sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Жолборс турат бүлүнүп,", "text": "Жолборс турат бүлүнүп,", "en": "The tiger stands in fury,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word appears to be бүлүнүп, though another closely formed verb is possible.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Кайран турат калбаны,", "text": "Кайран турат калбаны,", "en": "The hapless one stands, unable to remain,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second half is faint and may be a proper name or a different inflected form.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Азу турат азапка,", "text": "Азу турат азапка,", "en": "His fangs stand ready for torment,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Азу is a tentative visual reading; the line's grammar remains unresolved.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Бул балакет салганы,", "text": "Бул балакет салганы,", "en": "The calamity this one has brought,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Бул кызыңдан көрдүңбү?", "text": "Бул кызыңдан көрдүңбү?", "en": "Have you seen it from this daughter of yours?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The possessive word кызыңдан is visually likely, but the referent and exact sense are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Канча жерге топ тарткан,", "text": "Канча жерге топ тарткан,", "en": "How many lands he drew troops against,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Аны уруп жаман кара-мар,", "text": "Аны уруп жаман кара-мар,", "en": "Striking him, the wicked black host,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The closing expression кара-мар is a phonetic approximation of difficult handwriting; translation is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Жорткулары далай бар,", "text": "Жорткулары далай бар,", "en": "Many are his raiding marches,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Жорткулары is the closest reading; the medial letters are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Чоңдугу аттанып башындагы,", "text": "Чоңдугу аттанып башындагы,", "en": "His great ones rode at the head,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript may read another initial consonant in Чоңдугу; English follows the likely syntax.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Жан күткөрдүн сордугу,", "text": "Жан күткөрдүн сордугу,", "en": "The misery of those who cherish life,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "күткөрдүн is a tentative transcription of a very pale word.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Бир эмгек деген сөөгү бар,", "text": "Бир эмгек деген сөөгү бар,", "en": "He has a bone made for toil,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "сөөгү is visually plausible but the idiom and translation are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Түбү менен өрттү,", "text": "Түбү менен өрттү,", "en": "He burned it down to the roots,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb is abbreviated or faint and is provisionally normalized as өрттү.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Тиз караган кишинин,", "text": "Тиз караган кишинин,", "en": "Of the man who looked swiftly,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Тиз and the final suffix are tentative; the line is faint throughout.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Жүрөгү өзүнө айрылган,", "text": "Жүрөгү өзүнө айрылган,", "en": "His heart was torn within him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last verb may be a nearby form; айрылган matches the visible strokes.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Тиши өзүнө күчтүү,", "text": "Тиши өзүнө күчтүү,", "en": "His teeth themselves are strong,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Тиши is a close visual reading, though the first word may differ.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Билек деген күчтөдү,", "text": "Билек деген күчтөдү,", "en": "What is called his arm grew strong,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is difficult and provisionally read күчтөдү.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Сайкырчыны кандырды,", "text": "Сайкырчыны кандырды,", "en": "He satisfied the sorcerer,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Сайкырчыны may instead be another agent noun; several letters are lightly written.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Чубак уулга салыштырып,", "text": "Чубак уулга салыштырып,", "en": "Comparing him to Chubak's son,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The grammatical ending of уулга and the final verb are pale; this is the closest reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Эрен албай жыйылып,", "text": "Эрен албай жыйылып,", "en": "Gathering without finding a champion,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second word is visually ambiguous; албай is a contextual reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Эмеске курбай,", "text": "Эмеске курбай,", "en": "Not building it for one unworthy,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "This short line is very faint; both words and the English sense are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Кайраты күчтүү көрүнүп,", "text": "Кайраты күчтүү көрүнүп,", "en": "Appearing mighty in courage,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last verb is partially obscured and normalized to the likely form көрүнүп.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Кайраты жок чабал жан,", "text": "Кайраты жок чабал жан,", "en": "A weak soul without courage,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Ажалдан мурун өлүптүр,", "text": "Ажалдан мурун өлүптүр,", "en": "He died before his destined hour,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last word may be another past-tense form; өлүптүр best matches the visible letters.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Кан дүрбөтүп журт жыйнап,", "text": "Кан дүрбөтүп журт жыйнап,", "en": "Stirring bloodshed and gathering the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "дүрбөтүп is a contextual reading of a heavily joined handwritten word.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Суусунан менен Чын түштү,", "text": "Суусунан менен Чын түштү,", "en": "With his waters, truth descended,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "This is among the least secure lines: Суусунан and Чын are tentative visual readings, and the English is literal only.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Калкы Кытай жазасын,", "text": "Калкы Кытай жазасын,", "en": "The punishment of the Chinese people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The possessive relation is unclear; the handwritten words themselves are fairly legible.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Үчүнчүгө колго бердир,", "text": "Үчүнчүгө колго бердир,", "en": "Have the third one delivered into their hands,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The suffixes and imperative ending are tentative due to faint strokes.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Кан буйругу эки эмес,", "text": "Кан буйругу эки эмес,", "en": "A khan's command is never twofold,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Кармаш кылчу жан барбы,", "text": "Кармаш кылчу жан барбы,", "en": "Is there anyone who will fight?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first phrase is pale but fits the visible forms and context.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Кайраты үч жүз келиштир,", "text": "Кайраты үч жүз келиштир,", "en": "His courage is equal to three hundred,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first and last words are provisional; үч жүз is the clearest phrase in the line.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf026:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 26, "folio": 409, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Ошондо туруп баласы эсен,", "text": "Ошондо туруп баласы эсен,", "en": "Then his son stood there unharmed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is faint; эсен is the closest contextual reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Оңдого көзүн каратып,", "text": "Оңдого көзүн каратып,", "en": "[Uncertain: Turning his eyes to the right,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening directional form is difficult; Оңдого is provisional, possibly an inflection of оң. The final word is a verb, not the personal name Karagul.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Ороктолгон кабактуу,", "text": "Ороктолгон кабактуу,", "en": "With sickle-curved brows,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The medial letters of Ороктолгон are faint; curved-brow epithet is probable.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Өзү дүрбөп олтуруп,", "text": "Өзү дүрбөп олтуруп,", "en": "[Uncertain: Sitting there himself in agitation,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Өзү and олтуруп are clear; дүрбөп remains provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Кызыкты көрсөң мындай көр,", "text": "Кызыкты көрсөң мындай көр,", "en": "If you would see a marvel, look at this!", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Кырк эшиктүү капканын,", "text": "Кырк эшиктүү капканын,", "en": "Of the gateway with forty doors,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Бир эшигин ачтырып,", "text": "Бир эшигин ачтырып,", "en": "He had one door opened,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Сексен жыл жесе түгөнгүс,", "text": "Сексен жыл жесе түгөнгүс,", "en": "With enough to eat for eighty years,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Күл азыктан чачтырып,", "text": "Күл азыктан чачтырып,", "en": "He had dried travel provisions distributed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Manuscript separates Күл азыктан; printed witness joins Күлазыктан. The conventional provision name informs the translation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Көлүктүн баарын улоолоп,", "text": "Көлүктүн баарын улоолоп,", "en": "Putting all the pack animals to work,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Качырдын баарын жоорутуп,", "text": "Качырдын баарын жоорутуп,", "en": "Working all the mules saddle-sore,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Ханга эмине болду деп,", "text": "Ханга эмине болду деп,", "en": "“What has happened to the khan?” they said,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Калктын көөнүн оорутуп,", "text": "Калктын көөнүн оорутуп,", "en": "Causing the people distress,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The vowel sequence in көөнүн is faint but supported by the same-position printed witness.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Калтырбай жыйнап сынчыны,", "text": "Калтырбай жыйнап сынчыны,", "en": "Gathering every last seer,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word appears сынчыны, a judge or discerning seer; precise role uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Кайыбын жыйып алыптыр,", "text": "Кайыбын жыйып алыптыр,", "en": "[Uncertain: He gathered those versed in hidden things,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening word is poorly resolved; Кайыбын is provisional. Translation follows a possible connection with кайып, the unseen, in the seer context; requires re-reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Не сынганы бербесе,", "text": "Не сынганы бербесе,", "en": "[Uncertain: If he would not give his judgment,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The phrase before бербесе is unresolved; Не сынганы is provisional. English interpretation uses the preceding seer context and is not secure.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Айткан сөзгө көнбөсө,", "text": "Айткан сөзгө көнбөсө,", "en": "If he would not obey what was said,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Канын карап кылыптыр,", "text": "Канын карап кылыптыр,", "en": "[Uncertain: He had made their blood run dark,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word appears карап, possibly кара; full idiom and suffixes require specialist review. Not a line about watching the khan.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Кайрине жанга күч келип,", "text": "Кайрине жанга күч келип,", "en": "[Uncertain: Hardship came upon their lives,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening word Кайрине is unresolved; жанга күч келип is legible. English does not supply a confident reading for the opening word.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Калтырбай калкын жыйнаптыр.", "text": "Калтырбай калкын жыйнаптыр.", "en": "He gathered his people, leaving none behind.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Акыл тапкан Суурулган,", "text": "Акыл тапкан Суурулган,", "en": "Suurulgan, who had devised a plan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Суурулган буйрук кылганда,", "text": "Суурулган буйрук кылганда,", "en": "When Suurulgan gave the order,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Калың кытай кырк хан журт,", "text": "Калың кытай кырк хан журт,", "en": "The teeming Kytai, the people of forty khans,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Заманасы куурулган.", "text": "Заманасы куурулган.", "en": "Were sorely distressed.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Айдоор жагы кайсы деп,", "text": "Айдоор жагы кайсы деп,", "en": "“Where will he drive us?” they wondered,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Жагы is a probable reading; final vowel of Айдоор may be normalized differently.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Жанагы жорук кылар деп,", "text": "Жанагы жорук кылар деп,", "en": "Fearing he would do such a deed again,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening word appears Жанагы; some letter joins remain uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Жабыркатып көп элди,", "text": "Жабыркатып көп элди,", "en": "Bringing misery upon many people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Жазайласа кырар деп,", "text": "Жазайласа кырар деп,", "en": "[Uncertain: Fearing he would slaughter them in punishment,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Initial form appears Жазайласа, possibly a nonstandard form or another verb. Кырар деп is legible.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Артык каары билинип,", "text": "Артык каары билинип,", "en": "His great wrath became apparent,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Кайраты бар эрлери,", "text": "Кайраты бар эрлери,", "en": "Even his valiant warriors,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final inflection of эрлери is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Кайран жандан түңүлүп,", "text": "Кайран жандан түңүлүп,", "en": "Despairing of their precious lives,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Калбай дүрбөп жүрөт чуулдап,", "text": "Калбай дүрбөп жүрөт чуулдап,", "en": "All surged about in an uproar,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final participle appears чуулдап; handwriting joins are compressed.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Аскер болду төгүлгөн,", "text": "Аскер болду төгүлгөн,", "en": "The army poured forth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Төгүлгөн is probable but medial letters are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf027:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 27, "folio": 410, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Асманга чуу түшөт.", "text": "Асманга чуу түшөт.", "en": "Their clamor rose to the sky.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Эскинин баары эски экен,", "text": "Эскинин баары эски экен,", "en": "All that was old was indeed old,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Ташка урган баары тешилген,", "text": "Ташка урган баары тешилген,", "en": "All that struck the stone was pierced,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Кулакка кулак тийишип,", "text": "Кулакка кулак тийишип,", "en": "Ear pressed against ear,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Курттай чуулдап жүрүшүп,", "text": "Курттай чуулдап жүрүшүп,", "en": "They moved in a swarm, clamoring like worms,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Калк үркүшүп кол жайган,", "text": "Калк үркүшүп кол жайган,", "en": "The frightened people spread their hands,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Казакстан турганда,", "text": "Казакстан турганда,", "en": "While Kazakhstan stood there,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Кандай жерлик кандай дей,", "text": "Кандай жерлик кандай дей,", "en": "They asked what land and what kind it was,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf028:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 28, "folio": 411, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Кетти кээ жан сандалып,", "text": "Кетти кээ жан сандалып,", "en": "Some souls went off in bewilderment,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Best-effort reading from faint or difficult cursive; wording and English sense require later manuscript-specialist review.", "bbox": null}
